  "abstract": "Combine the best stability tweak (a_max=0.993) with AdamW (wd=1e-4) on the LayerNorm + H=96 variant (k=320,p=32, \u03b3_end=0.99). Retains residual copy, MAE+temporal curvature, and V-orthogonality (\u03bb=1e-5).",
